<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 17:19:16 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>人工智能驱动的条形码揭示了衰老组织中的“僵尸细胞”</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/ai-powered-barcode-unmasks-zombie-cells-in-aging-tissue</link><description>随着年龄的增长，我们体内的一些细胞进入衰老状态，它们停止分裂但不会死亡。这些衰老细胞可能导致与年龄相关的疾病，例如癌症、组织退化和炎症性疾病。麻省理工学院的研究人员开发了一种非侵入性方法来检测衰老生物标志物，这可能会导致更好的方法来诊断和治疗这些疾病。他们的方法基于拉曼显微镜，可以在不伤害细胞的情况下揭示细胞的生化成分。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/ai-powered-barcode-unmasks-zombie-cells-in-aging-tissue.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 17:19:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/ai-powered-barcode-unmasks-zombie-cells-in-aging-tissue</guid></item><item><title>新的 CRISPR 激活工具发现了驱动血癌耐药性的基因</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/gene-that-drives-blood-cancer-drug-resistance-uncovered-with-new-crispr-activation-tool</link><description>研究人员利用强大的新型 CRISPR 激活文库，发现了一种先前未知的基因，该基因会导致对一种主要血癌药物产生耐药性，以及几种加速淋巴瘤生长的基因。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/gene-that-drives-blood-cancer-drug-resistance-uncovered-with-new-crispr-activation-tool.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 17:04:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/gene-that-drives-blood-cancer-drug-resistance-uncovered-with-new-crispr-activation-tool</guid></item><item><title>定量蛋白质组学揭示复制衰老过程中蛋白质组的协调变化</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/quantitative-proteomics-reveals-coordinated-changes-in-the-proteome-during-replicative-senescence</link><description>衰老涉及细胞成分的大规模重组。这项研究表明，与其他细胞应激相比，核糖体蛋白和泛素蛋白酶体系统的变化是复制衰老的独特特征。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/quantitative-proteomics-reveals-coordinated-changes-in-the-proteome-during-replicative-senescence.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 16:49:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/quantitative-proteomics-reveals-coordinated-changes-in-the-proteome-during-replicative-senescence</guid></item><item><title>iPhone Duo 上手啦！</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/iphone-duo-hands-on</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 16:34:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/iphone-duo-hands-on</guid></item><item><title>未来冲击主题说唱</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/future-shock-keynote-rap</link><description>巴巴·布林克曼 (Baba Brinkman) 根据尼古拉·丹奈洛夫 (Nikola Danaylov) 在魁北克省加蒂诺举办的 The Event 上的主题演讲即兴表演了一首《Future Shock Rap》。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/future-shock-keynote-rap.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 16:19:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/future-shock-keynote-rap</guid></item><item><title>在接近原子厚度下稳定的铁电材料揭示了低功耗电子产品的新途径</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/ferroelectric-material-thats-stable-at-near-atomic-thickness-reveals-new-route-to-low-power-electronics</link><description>世界各地的电子工程师一直在尝试开发越来越小的组件，这些组件可以存储和处理信息，同时消耗更少的能量。铁电材料具有自发电极化，可以通过外部施加的电场反转，已被证明有望用于开发更密集、更节能的存储器和其他小型电子元件。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/ferroelectric-material-thats-stable-at-near-atomic-thickness-reveals-new-route-to-low-power-electronics.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 16:04:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/ferroelectric-material-thats-stable-at-near-atomic-thickness-reveals-new-route-to-low-power-electronics</guid></item><item><title>无人同意的 ChatGPT 跟踪 Cookie</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/the-chatgpt-tracking-cookie-nobody-consented-to</link><description>ChatGPT 跟踪 Cookie：OpenAI 正在跟踪您吗？了解 __obi cookie 发现，了解它如何跨 Chewy 和 Wayfair 等网站跟踪用户。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/the-chatgpt-tracking-cookie-nobody-consented-to.jpg" /&gt; 由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 15:49:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/the-chatgpt-tracking-cookie-nobody-consented-to</guid></item><item><title>科学家发现了一种奇怪的新形式的冰，可以帮助解释海王星和天王星的内部</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-discover-a-strange-new-form-of-ice-that-could-help-explain-the-interiors-of-neptune-and-uranus</link><description>科学家发现海王星和天王星等行星深处存在冰，并希望了解它的形式和行为。他们无法挖掘它并将其一路运回地球，因此他们做了退而求其次的事情：在实验室中重现那些极端条件。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-discover-a-strange-new-form-of-ice-that-could-help-explain-the-interiors-of-neptune-and-uranus2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 15:34:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-discover-a-strange-new-form-of-ice-that-could-help-explain-the-interiors-of-neptune-and-uranus</guid></item><item><title>当 GPS 失效时，紧密引导的原子可以实现低功率量子导航</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/tightly-guided-atoms-could-enable-low-power-quantum-navigation-when-gps-fails</link><description>在附着在一根极其细的光纤上的微小光晕中，科学家李钟民引导原子像弹珠一样穿过狭窄的管道。摇动纤维，原子并排移动；它们只是不会掉落。但不要被他的实验看似微妙的性质所欺骗。 Lee 正在探索如何在混乱的环境中精确测量运动。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/tightly-guided-atoms-could-enable-low-power-quantum-navigation-when-gps-fails2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 15:19:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/tightly-guided-atoms-could-enable-low-power-quantum-navigation-when-gps-fails</guid></item><item><title>您的扫地机器人是证人：家用机器人对证据、隐私和法律意味着什么</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/your-robotic-vacuum-is-a-witness-what-home-robots-mean-for-evidence-privacy-and-the-law</link><description>禁止秘密录音的法律适用于机器人吸尘器等家用设备，但这些录音仍然可以在法庭上用来对付你。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/your-robotic-vacuum-is-a-witness-what-home-robots-mean-for-evidence-privacy-and-the-law.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 15:04:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/your-robotic-vacuum-is-a-witness-what-home-robots-mean-for-evidence-privacy-and-the-law</guid></item></channel></rss>